---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P7｜Investment Matrix｜J 的世界 Research" page="P7" section="INVESTMENT MATRIX">
<div class="poster">
 <div class="poster-inner">
  <div class="poster-top"><div class="poster-kicker">P6 · INVESTMENT MATRIX</div><div class="poster-title">技術節點，<br/>如何轉成產業觀察？</div><div class="poster-sub">不要直接跳到股票，先把技術鏈拆開。</div></div>
  <div class="matrix-poster">
   <div class="left"><div class="lane"><b>01 · PROCESS</b><span>先進製程、設備、材料、設計服務</span></div><div class="lane"><b>02 · PACKAGING</b><span>CoWoS、SoIC、基板、封裝設備</span></div><div class="lane"><b>03 · OPTICAL</b><span>光互連、CPO、光電整合</span></div><div class="lane"><b>04 · MATERIALS</b><span>Glass Core、TGV、化學與檢測</span></div><div class="lane"><b>05 · INFRASTRUCTURE</b><span>電力、散熱、機房與系統</span></div></div>
   <div class="poster-panel"><div class="poster-kicker">OBSERVATION MATRIX</div><div class="matrix-grid" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>技術</strong><small>真的解決了什麼問題？</small></div><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>驗證</strong><small>誰在測？進到哪一階段？</small></div><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>導入</strong><small>是否進入設計與製程？</small></div><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>量產</strong><small>良率與產能是否成立？</small></div><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>客戶</strong><small>是否形成實際需求？</small></div><div class="matrix-cell"><strong>擴散</strong><small>是否由單一客戶走向產業？</small></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="poster-footer"><strong>INVESTMENT MATRIX</strong><span>Technology → Validation → Adoption → Production → Diffusion</span><span>P6</span></div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>閱讀方式</strong>矩陣不是推薦名單，而是一張「從技術進展往下追產業」的地圖。公司是否受惠，仍要回到實際產品、驗證與基本面。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
